  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 532fe926c7aac1b438cb9b71cd19eaf9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Bee
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CreatureData
  creatureName: Bee
  description: "I don\u2019t yet know if this is a bee-shaped fairy or just a mutated,
    magical kind of bee. Either way, its sweet tooth knows no limits and its body
    transforms the honey and sugar it eats into a very potent jelly. The sting is
    very hurtful and can leave a mark for months."
  note: "Note from Luc\xEDa: At first I thought it was cute because of its pink cheeks
    and big eyes, but the more I look at it the less I like it. It looks like a human
    girl and it\u2019s always happy, so it\u2019s a bit creepy."
  family: 0
  favoriteScent: 0
  hatedScent: 3
